    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: warpProperties.playerWarpPosition.y
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0]._dialogueText
      value: Hello <NAME>! I am here to test your knowledge!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[1]._dialogueText
      value: For a tutorial, I will be quite lenient with you, but as you progress,
        the questions will get a lot harder!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2]._dialogueText
      value: So, for my question, what is a "polynomial"?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: resultantDialogueObjects.Array.data[0]._dialogueText
      value: You are all good to proceed now! Best of luck with your adventure!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[0].choiceOptions.Array.size
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<ChoiceText>k__BackingField
      value: An expression containing variables and coefficients.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[1].<ChoiceText>k__BackingField
      value: 'A sequence of numbers that are in order '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[2].<ChoiceText>k__BackingField
      value: A graph plotting a list of numbers.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<CorrectAnswer>k__BackingField
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[1].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[2].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.data[0]._dialogueText
      value: Bingo! A polynomial is a mathematical expression made up of terms that
        are combined using mathematical operands!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[0].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.data[1]._dialogueText
      value: Each term consists of a variable (like x or y) raised to a non-negative
        integer power, multiplied by a coefficient (a number).
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[1].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.data[0]._dialogueText
      value: I am sorry, that wasn't quite the right answer. Please try again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3439179272996123904, guid: a149c31942a844dadb2c1830d4ea7459, type: 3}
      propertyPath: choiceDialogue.Array.data[2].choiceOptions.Array.data[2].<ResultingDialogue>k__BackingField.Array.data[0]._dialogueText
      value: Not exactly, that wasn't quite the right answer. Please try again.
